   "subject": " 🎉 dartR wins the Eureka Prize!",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p>Hi everyone,<br></p>\r\n<p>We’ve got some exciting news to share — <strong>dartR has just won the 2025 Australian Research Data Commons Eureka Prize for Excellence in Research Software!</strong> 🏆</p>\r\n<p>A huge thank you to all of you for using dartR, sharing feedback, and supporting the project. This recognition really belongs to the whole community, and it motivates us to keep improving and making dartR even better.</p>\r\n<p>You can read more about the award and what it means for dartR here:<br><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"http://georges.biomatix.org/blog/post/eureka-prize-dartr\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://georges.biomatix.org/blog/post/eureka-prize-dartr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457428828000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34aXZ-wTJ_fREL1bG-0IvG\">http://georges.biomatix.org/blog/post/eureka-prize-dartr<span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></p>\r\n<p>Thanks again for being part of the journey!</p><p>The dartR team</p>"
    ]
   ]
  },
